{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106571","id":2527162215,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6WoW9n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106571","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106571.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106571.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106571","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106571/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106571/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106571/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/69c7f9bd1f532668e6d2b32086bbd6430affedbd","number":106571,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add VehicleWing3D node for wing physics simulation","user":{"login":"wmigor","id":28404760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDA0NzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28404760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmigor","html_url":"https://github.com/wmigor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmigor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmigor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmigor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmigor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmigor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmigor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmigor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmigor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmigor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"VehicleWing3D used as a child of a VehicleBody3D parent to simulate the behavior of one of its wings. There are settings for flexible adjustment of the wing shape, control surfaces and aerodynamics. The aerodynamic formulas used here are from the paper \"Real-time modeling of agile fixed-wing UAV aerodynamics\" by Khan and Nahon 2015 https://www.researchgate.net/publication/264773227_Dynamics_Modeling_of_a_Highly-Maneuverable_Fixed-Wing_UAV.\r\n\r\nSetting:\r\nAdd VehicleWing3D to VehicleBody3D\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/72be9c9d-a157-4207-b967-20172f0106f0)\r\n\r\nAdjust the wing shape\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dd0a3296-2f30-4cf9-8624-7530622ba346)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd772dd3-9bc4-4df2-a402-c4f46ac3c00b)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/95bfd02c-ae3e-4685-b7a7-58787d48fc8c)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4918763a-620f-477d-806e-d40d5cd93ed4)\r\n\r\n\r\nAdjust control surfaces\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/32f659ab-e961-40c3-a56c-7287b7983514)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7cc68ac-3804-43e5-ab15-b2eabf4f06e4)\r\n\r\nSimilarly, add tail empennage\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/95010d28-8653-4f77-b240-f4f1b95368b6)\r\n\r\nControls\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15a2f812-6aef-4248-a892-9e70e87ed449)\r\n\r\nAerodynamic settings\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1fce4d0f-efbd-4c08-8844-268dd46910c0)\r\n\r\n\r\nPosition the center of mass near the wing location, disable damping, apply aircraft thrust, and enjoy the flight\r\n\r\nDemo: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/pull/1206\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a990f1e5-b1d8-4c32-b49e-d5b1afe10e71)\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12459*\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feat